@startuml 11-data-lifecycle-erasure-and-worker-jobs-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF9
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Inter, sans-serif"
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #5C534E

title F12 Data Export/Erasure, Account Closure, Cross-Case Evidence Holds & 6 Background Worker Jobs

actor "User" as User
actor "Operator\n(safety_specialist /\nprivacy_officer)" as Operator
participant "Client UI\n(DataPrivacyCenter /\nAccountClosure)" as Client
participant "Go API\n(mobile.Service)" as Api
participant "cmd/worker\n(mobileworker.Runner)" as Worker
participant "S3 Object Storage" as S3
database "PostgreSQL\n(mobile_data_requests /\nmobile_account_closures /\nmobile_evidence_holds)" as Db

== 1. Cross-Case Evidence Hold Guard (Blocks Premature Destruction of Evidence) ==
Operator -> Api : POST /api/v2/ops/evidence-holds\n(Role: safety_specialist) {targetUserId, sourceType: "dispute"|"safety_case", sourceId, reason}
Api -> Db : INSERT mobile_evidence_holds (status='active')
Api --> Operator : 201 EvidenceHoldView

== 2. User Requests Data Export / Data Erasure / Account Closure with Reauth ==
User -> Client : Open DataPrivacyCenter or AccountClosure -> Complete Reauth
Client -> Api : POST /api/v2/privacy/data-requests (kind="export"|"erasure")\nOR POST /api/v2/account/closure\nHeader: X-Reauth-Token: <reauthToken>
Api -> Db : Consume purpose_reauth_grant\nCheck HasActiveEvidenceHold(userID) + Check active Care obligations (Trial Adoption / Unresolved Claim)

alt Active Evidence Hold OR Unresolved Care Obligation exists
  Db --> Api : Hold active (e.g. hold_id="hold_123")
  Api -> Db : INSERT mobile_data_requests / mobile_account_closures\nSET status = 'blocked_by_hold', progress_json = {stage: "blocked_by_evidence_hold"}
  Api --> Client : 202 Accepted (Status: blocked_by_hold; transparent progress shown in UI)
else No active holds or blocking obligations
  Api -> Db : INSERT mobile_data_requests (status='queued') /\nINSERT mobile_account_closures (status='cooling_off', cool_off_until = now + 7d)
  Api --> Client : 202 Accepted (DataRequestProgress: queued / cooling_off)
end

== 3. cmd/worker Periodic Execution of 6 Deterministic Maintenance Jobs ==
loop Every Worker Tick (cmd/worker)
  Worker -> Api : 1. RunExpireReservations(now)
  Api -> Db : Expire unattached mobile_media_reservations past TTL -> status='pending_delete'

  Worker -> Api : 2. RunExpireDomainDeadlines(now)
  Api -> Db : Expire 15m guardian invites, 10m inbox snapshots, 72h adoption return proposals,\nand unaccepted appointment reschedule proposals (restoring effectiveVersion)

  Worker -> Api : 3. RunProcessPendingDataRequests(now)
  Api -> Db : Claim queued data export/erasure & matured account closures (now >= cool_off_until)\nRe-verify 0 active mobile_evidence_holds before destructive erasure
  Api -> Db : Anonymize PII, revoke sessions, mark media 'pending_delete', update DataRequestProgress='completed'

  Worker -> Api : 4. RunReconcileObjectDeletions(now)
  Api -> Db : Select media in 'pending_delete' with 0 active evidence holds
  Api -> S3 : DeleteObject(objectKey)
  Api -> Db : Update reservation status='deleted'

  Worker -> Api : 5. RunPurgeExpiredArtifacts(now)
  Api -> Db : Purge expired data export bundles, expired command ledger rows & consumed reauth grants

  Worker -> Api : 6. RunDispatchOutboxEvents(now)
  Api -> Db : Claim pending mobile_outbox_events (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)\nDispatch notifications & audit hooks -> mark status='dispatched'
end

@enduml
